From 729bcfcf629d9a9410903f0dbbb52f9895578692 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:14:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] MiniMax-M3.1-Flash: fp16 index projection and per-rank pick
 kernels (T8c)

Adds minimax_m3_proj.cu: tf_mm3_proj_bf16/f32 (fp16 index_q_proj and index_k_proj times
the normed hidden state, fp32 fma sums in a fixed lane/chain/xor-tree order that does not
depend on the row count, one rounding to fp16 or bf16 as a launch parameter) and
tf_mm3_pick (per-rank (logit, id) over the vocabulary slice: larger logit, ties to the
lowest id, NaN last). Wires index_proj, local_pick and pick_gather into Device.emit,
registers the image, records and float64-reference contract entries, host twins with
planted mutants, step test-minimax-proj and tf-cuda-test mm3-proj-contract. tp.betterPick
now ranks NaN last. Ran on GB10 (spark2): mm3-proj-contract, 4 kernels pass gates 1-4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
